{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Staffer Retro] is a detective adventure that explores past events related to supernatural powers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the Staffer series lies mana, the phenomenon that binds each story together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Verita on her journey into this mana's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will clock in at around thirty hours, totaling six episodes, each with endings that split depending on the results of the player's deductions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player will travel alongside protagonist Verita Retro as she crafts her own story using logic and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/964a30bd9ea358ddec762f02b71cabf7.avif?t=1756105169\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll find documents relating to supernatural abilities and maps with all sorts of clues left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine information from the documents in order to get closer to the truth buried in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/dba402f448ebdac3e055f12d22e754ff.avif?t=1756105169\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect information through dialogue and exploration,<br> changing the course of the story with logical deductions along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/383e2d3960b88a8f1a3bfea41c277c4f.avif?t=1756105169\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations that breathe life into more than 21 moving characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every character\u2014even the side characters\u2014has been crafted using Spine animations. Check out 35+ motions and poses in these high-quality character renders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/3b6d49fa01a94d81d2741fb0866e8d5a.avif?t=1756105169\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837350?t=1756105169","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837350?t=1756105169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/0d711f7b0cfe104c0d7ce977b41fa4d0aff82c72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756105169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/0d711f7b0cfe104c0d7ce977b41fa4d0aff82c72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756105169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Staffer Retro] is a detective adventure that explores past events related to supernatural powers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the Staffer series lies mana, the phenomenon that binds each story together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Verita on her journey into this mana's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will clock in at around thirty hours, totaling six episodes, each with endings that split depending on the results of the player's deductions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player will travel alongside protagonist Verita Retro as she crafts her own story using logic and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/964a30bd9ea358ddec762f02b71cabf7.avif?t=1756105169\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll find documents relating to supernatural abilities and maps with all sorts of clues left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine information from the documents in order to get closer to the truth buried in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/dba402f448ebdac3e055f12d22e754ff.avif?t=1756105169\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect information through dialogue and exploration,<br> changing the course of the story with logical deductions along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/383e2d3960b88a8f1a3bfea41c277c4f.avif?t=1756105169\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations that breathe life into more than 21 moving characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every character\u2014even the side characters\u2014has been crafted using Spine animations. Check out 35+ motions and poses in these high-quality character renders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/3b6d49fa01a94d81d2741fb0866e8d5a.avif?t=1756105169\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Team Tetrapod"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/9fe662ec4b46775e23748ccce0ad1344dfbd8ddc/header.jpg?t=1756105169","is_free":false,"linux_requiremen